# Two tasks each waiting on the other. Neither can ever be offered, so nothing
# goes red and nothing gets claimed — the queue simply has less work in it than
# it appears to, which is the failure a refusal exists to make loud.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: [M1-02]
	exclusive: no
	---
file tasks/M1-02.md
	---
	id: M1-02
	depends_on: [M1-01]
	exclusive: no
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/M1-02.md: depends_on M1-01 closes a cycle: M1-01 -> M1-02 -> M1-01
